WEBVTT

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.849
RIGHT, THEN! FIRST YEARS,
THIS WAY, PLEASE!

00:00:03.892 --> 00:00:05.198
COME ON NOW!

00:00:05.242 --> 00:00:06.460
FIRST YEARS, DON'T BE SHY!

00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:09.768
COME ON NOW.
HURRY UP. COME ON!

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:17.645
HELLO, HARRY.

00:00:17.689 --> 00:00:19.169
HEY, HAGRID.

00:00:19.212 --> 00:00:20.474
WHOA!

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:22.476
RIGHT, THEN.
THIS WAY TO THE BOATS.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:24.435
COME ON NOW. FOLLOW ME.

00:01:10.307 --> 00:01:12.091
WICKED.

00:01:40.772 --> 00:01:43.035
WELCOME TO HOGWARTS.

00:01:43.078 --> 00:01:44.732
NOW, IN A FEW MOMENTS,

00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:46.212
YOU WILL PASS
THROUGH THESE DOORS

00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:47.387
AND JOIN YOUR CLASSMATES,

00:01:47.431 --> 00:01:49.259
BUT BEFORE YOU CAN
TAKE YOUR SEATS,

00:01:49.302 --> 00:01:52.697
YOU MUST BE SORTED
INTO YOUR HOUSES.

00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.743
THEY ARE GRYFFINDOR,
HUFFLEPUFF,

00:01:55.787 --> 00:02:00.487
RAVENCLAW,
AND SLYTHERIN.

00:02:00.531 --> 00:02:02.533
NOW, WHILE YOU'RE HERE,

00:02:02.576 --> 00:02:06.145
YOUR HOUSE WILL BE
LIKE YOUR FAMILY.

00:02:06.188 --> 00:02:10.280
YOUR TRIUMPHS WILL
EARN YOU POINTS.

00:02:10.323 --> 00:02:14.458
ANY RULE-BREAKING,
AND YOU WILL LOSE POINTS.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.982
AT THE END OF THE YEAR,

00:02:17.025 --> 00:02:18.766
THE HOUSE
WITH THE MOST POINTS

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.115
IS AWARDED THE HOUSE CUP.

00:02:20.159 --> 00:02:21.595
TREVOR!

00:02:21.639 --> 00:02:24.250
[LAUGHTER]

00:02:24.294 --> 00:02:25.686
[CROAKING]

00:02:30.082 --> 00:02:31.301
SORRY.

